  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening reconciliation and peace strategies in Colombia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening reconciliation and peace strategies in Colombia. Generation of spaces for dialogue, promoting in particular participation of women, indigenous, afro colombians, and victims of conflict, based on mutual understanding and cooperation, for the construction of a new vision of peace. Training and promotion of social communication. Strengthening, promotion and dissemination of local and regional practices and traditions for the settlement of disputes.</narrative>
  </description>
